<meta type=article>
  <title | The Effect of Elephants on Climate>
  <author | Jane Goodall>
</meta>

<section | Introduction>
This paper examines how elephant populations affect regional climate patterns
through their role in shaping vegetation and carbon storage.

<section | Methods>
We surveyed forest density across three regions, comparing areas with and
without significant elephant populations. Sampling occurred over <em | three years>.
